@@ -247,6 +247,8 @@ with the new value of `RFB.clippingViewport`.
 #### clipboard
 
 The `clipboard` event is fired when the server has sent clipboard data.
+It is also fired when automatic browser clipboard synchronization is
+attempted; it does not indicate whether the browser clipboard was updated.
 The `detail` property is an `Object` containing the property `text`
 which is a `DOMString` with the clipboard data.
 
